OL,3,GNEWSABacking for 10-year safer cycling 
OL,4,Aplan in Hull                           
OL,6,FA 10-year plan to improve walking and  
OL,7,Fcycling routes across Hull has won     
OL,8,Fbacking from the city council as       
OL,9,Ffigures show cyclists accounted for a  
OL,10,Fquarter of all road casualties in 2023.
OL,12,FAccording to council documents, this   
OL,13,Fwas more than double the rate across   
OL,14,Fthe wider Yorkshire and the Humber     
OL,15,Fregion (10.7%) and England as a whole  
OL,16,F(11.6%) during the same period.        
OL,18,FThe Hull Local Cycling and Walking     
OL,19,FInfrastructure Plan (LCWIP) outlines   
OL,20,Fimprovements aimed at improving safety 
OL,21,Fand reducing carbon emissions.         
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
