OL,3,GNEWSABacking for 10-year safer cycling 
OL,4,Aplan in Hull                           
OL,6,FMark Ieronimo, the authority's cabinet 
OL,7,Fportfolio holder for transport and     
OL,8,Finfrastructure, said the scheme would  
OL,9,Fhelp residents make everyday journeys  
OL,10,Fwith greater confidence.               
